  {
   "text": "3. Now is described the method of finding the remainder of the dasa of ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    609,
    556,
    625
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "planet at the time of birth. Find out the nakshatra in which the Moon is posited at ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    633,
    556,
    649
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "birth and for how many ghatikas it will remain after birth in that nakshatra. ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    657,
    556,
    673
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Multiply those ghatikas by the total period of the dasa and divide it by 60. The ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    682,
    556,
    697
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "quotient will represent the period in years still to elapse. Any remainder remaining ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    706,
    556,
    721
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "may be converted into months by multiplying by 30 and dividing by 60 and so on.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    730,
    546,
    745
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Notes — This is clarified below by an example. Suppose at the time of birth ",
   "bbox": [
